{"page":{"id":"f7821f19-dab8-4929-bdd1-1a9be8c3f90a","theme":"dungeons-and-dragons","slug":"/dungeons-and-dragons/forgotten-realms/faerun/sword-coast","canonical_url":"https://www.tonolore.com/dungeons-and-dragons/forgotten-realms/faerun/sword-coast","title":"Sword Coast","meta_title":"Sword Coast (Dungeons & Dragons) — place, lore & connections | Ton-o-Lore","meta_description":"The Sword Coast is the western Faerûn frontier of walled cities, wild frontiers, and famous adventure sites stretching from Luskan toward Baldur's Gate.…","content":"<section class=\"intro\">\n    <p class=\"lead\">\n        Western <a href=\"/dungeons-and-dragons/forgotten-realms/faerun\" class=\"entity-link\">Faerûn</a> frontier of coastal cities.\n    </p>\n\n    \n    <p>\n        Key threads from this canonical page lead to\n        <a href=\"/dungeons-and-dragons/forgotten-realms/faerun/sword-coast/waterdeep\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Waterdeep</strong></a>, <a href=\"/dungeons-and-dragons/forgotten-realms/faerun/sword-coast/baldurs-gate\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Baldur&#039;s Gate</strong></a>, <a href=\"/dungeons-and-dragons/forgotten-realms/faerun\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Faerûn</strong></a>, <a href=\"/dungeons-and-dragons/forgotten-realms/faerun/sword-coast/candlekeep\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Candlekeep</strong></a> and <a href=\"/dungeons-and-dragons/forgotten-realms\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Forgotten Realms</strong></a>.\n        Each link is another long-tail path through the subject.\n    </p>\n\n</section>\n\n\n\n\n\n<section class=\"connection-narrative\">\n    <h2>How Sword Coast connects</h2>\n    <p>\n        These mapped links are unique to this page — each one is another\n        long-tail route through the subject graph.\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n        \n        <li>\n            <strong>Contains:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/dungeons-and-dragons/forgotten-realms/faerun/sword-coast/waterdeep\" class=\"entity-link\">Waterdeep</a>\n      